OL,3,GNEWSAMen's group needs new shed it can
OL,4,Acall home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community group helping people tackle
OL,7,Floneliness and learn new skills is
OL,8,Fsearching for a permanent home.
OL,10,FMen in Sheds Hedon & District currently
OL,11,Fmeets at the town's Royal British
OL,12,FLegion Club, but it is looking to find
OL,13,Fa workshop suitable enough for its
OL,14,Fbuilding activities.
OL,16,FThe group, which became part of Humber
OL,17,FMen in Sheds Alliance as a registered
OL,18,Fcharity in November, meets every
OL,19,FWednesday and encourages people to come
OL,20,Ftogether to make, repair and repurpose
OL,21,Fitems for the community.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
