OL,3,GNEWSAMen's group needs new shed it can
OL,4,Acall home
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrustee Ian McColm, 69, said: "People
OL,7,Fhave sheds at the bottom of their
OL,8,Fgardens but they miss the cup of
OL,9,Fcoffee, the natter, the community
OL,10,Fspirit."
